                    Papers, President’s Evening Reading January–March 1984. Secret.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d223-f2" n="2" xml:id="d223-f2-content">
                <p>A record of the Shultz-Karim-Lamrani conversation is in telegram 61214 to Rabat,
                    March 1. (Department of State, Central Foreign Policy File, Electronic
                    Telegrams, D840137–0085)</p>
            </note>
